    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="2395d93b-1379-5683-a809-2fd7979f7586" activityNameId="5650da27-0752-5b08-ad7c-b252a08657f5" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Lithium chloride, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Lithium chloride, at plant
The process "lithium chloride, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  lithium chloride from lithium carbonate and chlorine in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation, Energy consumptions are calculated with literature data. Emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 007447-41-8; 
Formula: LiCl; 
UUID: 5b825402-c959-3e1f-a3bf-96b278e4f513
Production of lithium chloride including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world.
Technology: Chlorination of lithium carbonate
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: Emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5b825402-c959-3e1f-a3bf-96b278e4f513.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
